---
name: vps-memory-router
description: L0 agent router for .agents/memory/, linking CoALA long-term memory TOC, host profile, and overflow topic catalog.
zh_summary: VPS 记忆目录 `.agents/memory/` 的 L0 Agent 路由索引，登记长期记忆导航 `README.md`、宿主机画像 `host-profile.md` 及超阈值分片目录。
tags: [memory, index, l0-router, host-profile, coala]
index: [AGENTS.md, .agents/INDEX.md, .agents/MEMORY.md, .agents/memory/README.md, .agents/memory/host-profile.md]
---

<index>
DIR:
  path: .agents/memory
  human_readme: .agents/memory/README.md
  parent_index: .agents/INDEX.md

FILES:
  toc_memory: .agents/MEMORY.md (0600, <=150L/12KB managed TOC + preserved user seed notes)
  host_profile: .agents/memory/host-profile.md (0600, managed markers refreshed on init | custom tail preserved)
  archive_dir: .agents/memory/archive/ (0700 dir, 0600 archived/superseded/promoted shards)
  search_cache: .agents/cache/memory_index.json (0600, incremental mtime+size+sha256 BM25 index)

SCALING_RULES:
  topic_caps: <=200 lines & <=16384 bytes per shard | <=80 lines per fenced code block
  sub_sharding: >15 active topics -> domain sub-sharding & overflow catalog maintained here
  write_gate: fail-closed rc=21 schema/provenance | rc=22 bloat | rc=23 secret leak

CROSS_LINKS:
  root_guide: AGENTS.md
  memory_rules: docs/agent/constraints/40_memory_and_retention.md
  atomic_ops_rules: docs/agent/constraints/30_atomic_ops_and_audit.md
  topic_schema: .agents/schemas/memory_topic.schema.json
  audit_log: .agents/logs/audit.jsonl
</index>
